    "evidence": "Re-derived 2026-07-31 across the tracked wrapper surfaces. Reservoir's verified Savingcoin source for Ethereum wsrUSD is a constructor-deployed ERC-4626/ERC20 with MANAGER and DEFAULT_ADMIN roles for cap/rate/update/recovery operations, but no blacklist, freeze, pause, seize, or arbitrary-holder-burn function; the 15 EVM representation deployments use the same 12,275-byte LayerZero OFT code family with ordinary transfer paths. Solana finalized slot 436244454 (2026-07-30T23:20:08Z) for mint 7bxM8cRF... reports freezeAuthority = null. The wrapper therefore has no current local holder-freeze reach. Upstream access is inherited from tracked rUSD: Tempo rUSD TIP-20 currently reads paused() = false and transferPolicyId() = 1 at block 32494649, but the Reservoir admin can activate TIP-403 blacklist/transfer policy, pause, or burnBlocked controls under the TIP-20 standard. Failure domain is the Reservoir rUSD parent/Tempo admin, not wsrUSD's wrapper or OFT contracts.",
